<div type="jEditorialStaff"><p><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#g">Eigenthum der Lassalleaner</hi>.</hi></p></div><lb/>
<cb n="3"/>
<div type="jExpedition"><p>Diese Blätter<lb/>
